WEBVTT

00:00.840 --> 00:04.360
Okay, you have your two to three SMART goals.

00:04.360 --> 00:07.160
Now we build the action plan.

00:07.160 --> 00:12.160
This is where you use your 90-Day Way Core 4 scorecard.

00:12.160 --> 00:15.760
The 90 day plan is rooted in your M.V.P. and values.

00:15.760 --> 00:18.500
It incorporates both your professional

00:18.500 --> 00:20.640
and personal priorities.

00:20.640 --> 00:23.480
For each goal, your plan guides you

00:23.480 --> 00:26.800
to ask four critical questions.

00:26.800 --> 00:31.560
First, what daily or weekly actions are required?

00:31.560 --> 00:34.880
Break the goal into concrete steps.

00:34.880 --> 00:38.120
Second, what resources are needed?

00:38.120 --> 00:41.600
Is it time, money, introductions,

00:41.600 --> 00:44.320
a specific piece of information?

00:44.320 --> 00:47.840
Third, who is in your corner?

00:47.840 --> 00:50.320
An athlete does not train alone.

00:50.320 --> 00:53.600
They build an ecosystem of accountability.

00:53.600 --> 00:58.600
This requires creating alignment on multiple fronts.

00:58.860 --> 01:03.320
With your manager, what conversations do you need to have

01:03.320 --> 01:06.200
to get their support and buy in?

01:06.200 --> 01:09.440
With your team, how will you communicate your goals

01:09.440 --> 01:12.000
so they can support the vision?

01:12.000 --> 01:13.900
And with your loved ones at home,

01:13.900 --> 01:15.600
what do they need to know

01:15.600 --> 01:18.680
to be a part of your support system?

01:18.680 --> 01:21.100
Think about the right cadence for check-ins

01:21.100 --> 01:24.500
with each of these groups to keep them engaged,

01:24.500 --> 01:27.500
but also to keep yourself on track.

01:27.500 --> 01:30.780
And finally, what is the deadline?

01:30.780 --> 01:32.500
How will you celebrate?

01:32.500 --> 01:35.340
Deadlines drive execution.

01:35.340 --> 01:39.680
And celebrating as an outcome, even if it's a small win,

01:39.680 --> 01:42.280
is what builds the positive momentum

01:42.280 --> 01:45.780
that makes you want to tackle the next goal.

01:45.780 --> 01:50.520
It's a crucial part of your wellbeing and resilience.

01:50.520 --> 01:53.320
This plan is a living document.

01:53.320 --> 01:54.580
It's flexible.

01:54.580 --> 01:57.960
It gives you direction, but it also allows you to pivot

01:57.960 --> 02:00.520
when the unexpected happens.

02:00.520 --> 02:03.080
In your playbook, you'll use the template

02:03.080 --> 02:06.060
to build out your first 90-day plan

02:06.060 --> 02:08.080
for each of your SMART goals.

02:08.080 --> 02:12.020
This is your roadmap for the next three months.

